ind":"update","title":"0.1.22 Demo Version Update Notes","summary":"Hello.This update makes the gameplay experience much smoother!We improved the controls that previously felt frustrating and made several changes so the game is easier and more enjoyable to play.\\1) New Pathogens AddedWe created 22 new pathogens this month, and some of them have been added to the demo version. More than 100 additional cards have also been created, but those cards will be revealed in the full version.2) Changes to Some Card EffectsWe know that having to end a turn because there ar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T13:36:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377651","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718090-1842212951296759","game_id":"steam-4718090","kind":"update","title":"0.1.16 Demo Update & Early Access Release Schedule Change","summary":"Hello. I'm DD， a solo developer.Once again， thank you to everyone who visited my booth during BIC.I received far more feedback and support than I expected， and it gave me the courage and motivation to work even harder. Thanks to everyone who enjoyed Pathogen， the game made it into the TOP 5 in the BIC Game Design category， which gave me confidence in its potential. At BIC， I mentioned that although the schedule was not finalized， I was planning to release the game around November this year. Howe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T12:35:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296759","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718090-1835871199306639","game_id":"steam-4718090","kind":"announcement","title":"Pathogen Demo Version Released!","summary":"G